  "description": "Chemical Guys Insynchro Supreme Extreme Compound - Extra Strong Professional Compound for Paint Defects, Scratches and Swirls - High Gloss Correction for Cars - Distributed/Packaged by Chemical Guys. Product Details: Insynchro Supreme Extreme Compound (GAP12216SW) is the strongest cutting compound from Chemical Guys for extreme paint correction. Designed for professionals and perfectionists, this ultra-resistant formula removes strong oxidation, deep scratches and heavy sanding marks to restore neglected surfaces.Powered by advanced micro grinding technology, the Insynchro Supreme Extreme blend provides a controlled and aggressive cut that ends smoothly and clearly. The extended lubrication system provides a long service life and reduces dust, helps you effectively eliminate defects with minimal cleaning. Whether you are restoring aged paint, eliminating deep defects or preparing the surface for a complete detail, this compound restores clarity, depth and shine in fewer passes.Safe for all types of varnishes, including clear coats, one-step surfaces and gel polish, fits perfectly with rotation, double or long distance polishing machines. From retail studios to catering workshops, the Insynchro Supreme Extreme Compound sets a new standard in robust correction and leaves a smooth, glossy finish ready to shine.",
